          "capture_failed": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    "outcome": "zero capture failures in twelve runs. The collapse was observed only inside the scored evaluation's run sequence, never in isolation, so accumulated device state is a co-factor and node mutation alone is not a demonstrated cause. It has not been seen on the unhooked control or the safe attach path, but eight clean runs do not establish a rate."
  },
